#       cell individually.
#     - Concrete example: if the true center is
#           6 9 6
#           9 5 9
#           6 9 6
#       the input may show
#           6 9 6
#           8 1 9
#           6 9 6
#       where the ring cells are already correct but the middle-left and center cells are
#       corrupted. The output must restore the full true center.
#   complexity_calibration:
